WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.110
Put a metal ball on an insulating stand.

2
00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.940
Touch a charged rod to one point on it.

3
00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:09.570
Extra charge arrives on the
ball, right at that spot.

4
00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:10.930
Take the rod away.

5
00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:14.560
In a tiny fraction of a
second, everything settles.

6
00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.750
Where has the extra charge gone?

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.490
And what field is left inside the metal?

8
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:23.610
In this mission, you'll find out
what equilibrium means for a metal.

9
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:27.830
Then you'll map the field lines
around solid and hollow metal spheres,

10
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.540
inside and out.

11
00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:32.540
Your mission: find out
where the charge goes,

12
00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.430
and what the field inside is.
